[
{
"start": 16.2,
"end": 21.0,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Linear is the task management tool built for speed \u2013 designed for keyboard use.",
"char_start": 17,
"char_end": 96,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s02"
},
{
"start": 21.06,
"end": 22.74,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Try linear.com today.",
"char_start": 97,
"char_end": 118,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s03"
},
{
"start": 22.74,
"end": 30.9,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Before we get into the topic, Rafael Vasconcelos was on the show to discuss how drainage is the design decision with the biggest impact.",
"char_start": 119,
"char_end": 255,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s04"
},
{
"start": 30.9,
"end": 31.86,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "Yes, exactly.",
"char_start": 271,
"char_end": 284,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s01"
},
{
"start": 31.92,
"end": 34.02,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "And it connects to what we're going to discuss today.",
"char_start": 285,
"char_end": 338,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s02"
},
{
"start": 34.02,
"end": 39.96,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "I want to point out something \u2013 Rafael Vasconcelos mentioned this same dynamic a few episodes ago.",
"char_start": 356,
"char_end": 454,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s01"
},
{
"start": 210.0,
"end": 211.56,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Give me a concrete example.",
"char_start": 455,
"char_end": 482,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s02"
},
{
"start": 211.62,
"end": 214.98,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 483,
"char_end": 533,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s03"
},
{
"start": 214.98,
"end": 220.68,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "Honestly, speed comes from braking earlier and more smoothly, not from taking bigger risks.",
"char_start": 549,
"char_end": 640,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s01"
},
{
"start": 220.74,
"end": 223.14,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use RockShox.",
"char_start": 641,
"char_end": 684,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s02"
},
{
"start": 223.2,
"end": 226.38,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 685,
"char_end": 754,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s03"
},
{
"start": 226.38,
"end": 227.7,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
"char_start": 772,
"char_end": 805,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s01"
},
{
"start": 227.76,
"end": 231.12,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 806,
"char_end": 856,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s02"
},
{
"start": 231.12,
"end": 231.48,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "Certainly.",
"char_start": 872,
"char_end": 882,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s01"
},
{
"start": 231.54,
"end": 237.78,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "Tire pressure and the choice of tire casing often matter more than a minor suspension adjustment.",
"char_start": 883,
"char_end": 980,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s02"
},
{
"start": 237.84,
"end": 241.86,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "Understanding the setup is important because it tells you what compromises you are making.",
"char_start": 981,
"char_end": 1071,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s03"
},
{
"start": 241.86,
"end": 242.88,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Let's start there.",
"char_start": 1089,
"char_end": 1107,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s01"
},
{
"start": 242.94,
"end": 246.3,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 1108,
"char_end": 1158,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s02"
},
{
"start": 246.3,
"end": 252.78,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "Honestly, risk management in racing isn't about avoiding crashes; it's about choosing which crashes are survivable.",
"char_start": 1174,
"char_end": 1289,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s01"
},
{
"start": 252.84,
"end": 255.18,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Shimano.",
"char_start": 1290,
"char_end": 1332,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s02"
},
{
"start": 255.24,
"end": 259.26,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "If you ignore this, you'll end up rebuilding everything from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 1333,
"char_end": 1415,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s03"
},
{
"start": 259.26,
"end": 261.36,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Where does it stop working?",
"char_start": 1433,
"char_end": 1460,
"unit_id": "t0010.u01",
"sent_id": "t0010.s01"
},
{
"start": 261.36,
"end": 265.62,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "The Cascadia Alliance is one of the platforms where this is clearly evident.",
"char_start": 1476,
"char_end": 1552,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s01"
},
{
"start": 265.68,
"end": 269.76,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
"char_start": 1553,
"char_end": 1624,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s02"
},
{
"start": 269.76,
"end": 272.16,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What heuristic do you always go back to?",
"char_start": 1642,
"char_end": 1682,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s01"
},
{
"start": 272.22,
"end": 275.16,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "How does Spoke & Wrench fit into this picture?",
"char_start": 1683,
"char_end": 1729,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s02"
},
{
"start": 275.16,
"end": 275.82,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 1745,
"char_end": 1765,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s01"
},
{
"start": 275.88,
"end": 282.48,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "The erosion patterns on the track sections can change the optimal racing line between practice sessions and the actual race day.",
"char_start": 1766,
"char_end": 1894,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s02"
},
{
"start": 840.0,
"end": 841.32,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
"char_start": 1912,
"char_end": 1945,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s02"
},
{
"start": 841.38,
"end": 844.38,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What is the most important version of that question?",
"char_start": 1946,
"char_end": 1998,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s03"
},
{
"start": 844.38,
"end": 846.9,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "I'm giving you the version that I truly believe in.",
"char_start": 2014,
"char_end": 2065,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s01"
},
{
"start": 846.96,
"end": 851.82,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "Speed comes from braking earlier and more smoothly, not from taking bigger risks.",
"char_start": 2066,
"char_end": 2147,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s02"
},
{
"start": 851.88,
"end": 854.28,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use RockShox.",
"char_start": 2148,
"char_end": 2191,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s03"
},
{
"start": 854.34,
"end": 858.42,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "And the secondary effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
"char_start": 2192,
"char_end": 2260,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s04"
},
{
"start": 858.42,
"end": 859.8,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What is the failure mode?",
"char_start": 2278,
"char_end": 2303,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s01"
},
{
"start": 859.86,
"end": 864.18,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What is the operational angle that most listeners don't have access to?",
"char_start": 2304,
"char_end": 2375,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s02"
},
{
"start": 864.18,
"end": 871.2,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "Yes, so \u2013 tire pressure and the choice of tire casing often matter more than a minor suspension adjustment.",
